{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤璃果です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかがお過ごしでしょうか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZC19A6CAK3MBM5WRHP40XF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リアルミーグリ有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はコロナ禍に加入したので、\n皆様一人一人と直接お話したのは\n4年目にして初めてで…！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで長かったので嬉しさは一入でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても嬉しくて楽しい時間でした☺︎\n有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"対面になってから初めて来てくれた方、\nこの日のために遠くから来てくれた方、\nそして、オンラインのミーグリによく来て下さる方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと会ってお話ししたかったよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しさ溢れる私でした😽"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また会えるといいな\nたくさん初めましてできるといいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからが楽しみです☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZC1ARF74NME1RM342EJF90","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZC1BS1SAWGNP1DESHAKQE4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花もたくさん！！ありがとう😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お話ししている時の後ろが\nとっても華やかになりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休憩時間癒されてました💐"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くまたみんなに会いたいな〜🐈🤍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZC1CS86EWD4F68K6SEZGC8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type